# DEPRECATED — do not use.
#
# Zigbee no longer runs on the C6. It moved to a dedicated NanoH2 (ESP32-H2)
# reached over UART from the P4. See firmware/nanoh2/.
#
# This file configured the old "ZigbeeExclusive" C6 build (ZBOSS coordinator
# on the shared radio), which is exactly the arrangement that caused ESP-NOW
# to drop when Zigbee was active. It is retained only as a historical marker;
# building with it will put a ZBOSS coordinator back on the C6 radio and
# reintroduce the coexistence failure.
#
# For the C6, use hosted/sdkconfig.defaults.modulus (Wi-Fi/ESP-NOW/BLE +
# Thread, no Zigbee).
